From 2f3728ba9e3ff0a41c4af3aa92653bff9ac46a2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tango <yanghan81@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:59:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: workspace rail (left sidebar) + chrome://desktop home
 page

- WorkspaceRailView: letter avatar + desktop/AI/files/skills/tasks buttons
- chrome://desktop WebUI: greeting + live clock + app grid (mock)
- Desktop page registered as internal WebUI (enabled by default)
- Rail inserted into BrowserView layout, contents area shifted right
- Fixes: a11y names on rail buttons, dangling raw_ptr on close,
  internal-WebUI pref default, pak aggregation into resources.pak
